==Description==

The [[Image:BIM_Copy.svg|24px]] [[BIM_Copy|BIM Copy]] tool is a shortcut to the standard [[Draft_Move|Draft Move]] tool, but starting with its '''Copy''' option turned on, therefore allowing to create a copy of an object and place it at a given location, in one go.


